  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      114.0,
      383.11,
      286.68,
      404.48
    ],
    "text": "My No.: KOT/LND/ACQVI/01/41. Land Min. Ref.No.: LD/05/2003/VEP/486.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      415.03,
      286.65,
      481.73
    ],
    "text": "I hereby notify under Sub-section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendments) Act No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      485.11,
      286.67,
      594.32
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: Allotments of the land called Handfered estate alias Kekunahena situated at Mathugobe Village in the Grama Niladhari\u2019s Division Tennipita (241B) of the Divisional Secretariat, Kotapola in Matara District in Southern Province, depicted as Lot No. 1406 of Supplementary Sheet No. 120, Sheet No. 102 of F. V. P. 169 made by the Surveyor General containing in extent about 0.865 Hectare and boundaries of the land given below:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      593.36,
      289.08,
      643.28
    ],
    "text": "Owner of the land : Land reforms Commission; Leaseholder of the land: Thalawekele Plantation Company Ltd.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      331.27,
      539.64,
      398.72
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of the land called Handferdwatta alias Kekunahena Lot No. 1406, containing in extent about 0.865 Hectare. North by: Road and Lot No. 87; East by: Road and Lot No. 87; South by: Lot No.87; West by: Road.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      397.76,
      542.23,
      533.84
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Kotapola on 21st day of September, 2015 at 10.00 a.m.. Further, I hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 14th day of September, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      534.79,
      529.56,
      652.64
    ],
    "text": "GANESHA AMARASINGHE, Divisional Secretary, Kotapola. At the Divisional Secretariat, Kotapola. 05th August, 2015. 08 \u2013659",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
